      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1900-03-16_WidnesExaminer_art0092" n="art0092">
        <head>(COUPON ON PAGE 7.) £5O Offered Weekly—,2loo Aggregate Prize. . RESULT OF LAST WEEK'S COMPETITION.</head>
        <p>(COUPON ON PAGE 7.) £5O Offered Weekly—,2loo Aggregate Prize. . RESULT OF LAST WEEK'S COMPETITION.</p>
        <p>,63 WON.</p>
