      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1900-03-16_WidnesExaminer_art0099" n="art0099">
        <head>EXAMINER, FRIDAY; MARCH 16, 1900.</head>
        <p>THE EXAMINER, FRIDAY; MARCH 16, 1900.</p>
        <p>RUGBY FOOTBALL.</p>
        <p>CRICKETRRS I Bussey's Demon Driver Bats are the grandest made. Bussmr's New Match Balls retain their shape, and last longer than any others. BUSSEY'S Leg Guards are exceptionatly good. BUS+EY'S Batting Gloves are far superior to the usual digs. BUSHEY'S B:gs are made to wear. BUSHEY'S Diary and Companion is a Gem for 6d. Apply for BUzHEY's Catalogue from Local Sports Out- fitters ; 36 and 33 Queen Victoria Street. or 213. Regent St.. London. Factories : Peckham, London; and Elmswell. Suffolk.—Advt. (3).</p>
