        <p>is asked for. Veno's —lightning— Cough Cure Is the most sucee•sful medicine in 1- ngland for the rapid and (ffecoire cure of Coughs. Brrnehitis, Asthma, Influenza, and Whcsp- ing Cough. It has the largest sale and the greatest record. Is. :lid. and Soli by Knowles, Warrington ; reake, E r!estown and Newton ; W,ston, Runcorn ; Foggitt, Widnes; Boots Ltd., and all Chemists. and Co-operative Stores.</p>
